{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>him his father loved more than all his brothers</b> — in gematria: שגלה סוד לו בלבד ולא להם = \"that a secret was revealed to him alone and not to them.\"" "<b>לשלם</b> — defective, lacking vav, equals 400, which brought about the 400 of servitude. Another interpretation: read here לשלם as qere — ששלמו לו גמולו = \"that they paid him his recompense.\""], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:17:48.576359879Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}